WEBVTT

01:46.980 --> 01:47.940
Senior Lijun.

01:51.120 --> 01:52.180
Do you think…

01:53.120 --> 01:55.160
Sisi’s boyfriend

01:55.200 --> 01:56.960
can tell she’s lying?

01:57.000 --> 01:58.960
He can tell or not…

01:59.000 --> 02:00.520
honestly, who cares?

02:00.560 --> 02:01.680
What matters is

02:01.720 --> 02:03.600
he’s finally gotten Sisi’s message.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.020
He won't come bothering her again.

02:07.680 --> 02:09.780
That sounds so heartbreaking.

02:09.820 --> 02:11.039
Really?

02:12.040 --> 02:14.160
I’m just relieved for them.

02:14.900 --> 02:17.300
A whole year of that

02:17.340 --> 02:18.400
back-and-forth drama

02:19.160 --> 02:21.080
finally clearing the air today.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.200
Honestly, it’s relief for them both.

02:24.060 --> 02:26.420
I always thought you two
were really close friends.

02:27.940 --> 02:29.580
We are good friends,

02:30.820 --> 02:33.380
but that’s got nothing to do with this.

02:33.920 --> 02:34.800
Just look at

02:34.840 --> 02:36.700
all the couples at the dorm gate tonight.

02:36.740 --> 02:39.900
They are all clinging
like they’ve found the one.

02:39.940 --> 02:41.860
Fast-forward a few months,

02:41.900 --> 02:43.800
they’ll be hugging

02:43.840 --> 02:45.980
and kissing someone new.

02:46.020 --> 02:47.820
Nobody stays in anyone’s memory for long.

02:48.320 --> 02:50.020
Graduation’s coming,

02:50.060 --> 02:52.600
we’ll all scatter

02:52.640 --> 02:54.000
for various reasons anyway.

02:56.020 --> 02:57.560
Not everyone.

02:58.500 --> 03:00.640
Some do last for ages.

03:01.180 --> 03:02.060
Oh yeah?

03:03.440 --> 03:04.440
Name one.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.880
- Like my…
- Don’t even say "your parents".

03:07.600 --> 03:09.040
You know that doesn’t count.

03:13.300 --> 03:14.540
Senior Lijun.

03:15.900 --> 03:17.580
You’re only three years older than me.

03:17.620 --> 03:19.640
Why do you always act like
you are the wise adult?

03:20.660 --> 03:22.320
What acting?

03:22.360 --> 03:24.740
Please, I am one.

03:24.780 --> 03:26.460
Kid, you'll make it too after 18.

03:27.040 --> 03:29.300
Welcome to adulthood

03:29.340 --> 03:31.680
where reality bites and fairy tales die.

03:38.560 --> 03:41.420
Since when do adults
lose the right to fall in love?

03:43.160 --> 03:44.380
Did you talk to me?

03:45.100 --> 03:46.420
I said

03:46.460 --> 03:48.000
even adults

03:48.040 --> 03:49.620
have the right to fall in love.

03:49.660 --> 03:51.520
What about you?
Anyone special caught your eye?

03:52.260 --> 03:53.720
Obviously I do.

03:53.760 --> 03:55.260
Exactly!

03:57.920 --> 04:00.660
So spill, what’s your type?

04:05.920 --> 04:07.520
He and I…

04:07.560 --> 04:08.800
knew each other from childhood.

04:09.300 --> 04:11.720
He’s nothing like anyone else,

04:12.220 --> 04:13.700
always misreading my words,

04:13.740 --> 04:15.940
orbiting a world away.

04:17.519 --> 04:18.560
But god,

04:19.339 --> 04:21.440
that gorgeous face.

04:22.019 --> 04:23.780
One glance

04:23.820 --> 04:27.080
and time freezes,

04:27.800 --> 04:29.780
my stomach becomes a butterfly aviary.

04:30.860 --> 04:31.840
Same here.

04:33.500 --> 04:35.040
The person I like,

04:35.080 --> 04:37.100
we’ve known each other
since we were kids, too.

04:38.740 --> 04:40.020
And those feelings you described,

04:40.060 --> 04:42.800
I’ve felt them all.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.840
But the person I like…

04:45.340 --> 04:46.740
is 15 years older.

04:47.740 --> 04:50.140
About eight years back, he got married

04:50.800 --> 04:53.040
to someone stunning, of course.

04:53.080 --> 04:55.340
They look perfect together, honestly.

04:55.380 --> 04:57.360
Seeing how right they are together,

04:57.400 --> 04:59.520
I can’t even be mad.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.600
Two kids now, too.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.460
Wait, hold on.

05:03.540 --> 05:05.080
Your crush

05:05.120 --> 05:06.940
is a married man now? With kids?

05:06.980 --> 05:08.420
He married eight years ago?

05:09.360 --> 05:10.540
Back then, you were 13!

05:14.260 --> 05:16.360
The person I like is…

05:16.900 --> 05:18.120
a celebrity.

05:21.800 --> 05:22.760
What is it?

05:23.500 --> 05:25.160
I like him very much.

05:25.960 --> 05:27.960
Who is the person that our Yingtao likes?

05:28.000 --> 05:29.320
I won't tell you!

05:30.840 --> 05:32.800
Liar! You big meanie!

05:34.260 --> 05:35.500
Liar!

05:36.500 --> 05:38.700
You liar!

05:46.940 --> 05:47.900
Jiang Qiaoxi.

05:48.480 --> 05:49.800
I just realized today,

05:50.620 --> 05:52.120
after 18,

05:52.160 --> 05:53.780
this so-called "adult world"

05:54.660 --> 05:56.380
isn’t fun at all.

05:57.540 --> 06:00.340
Did you go there first

06:00.380 --> 06:02.080
and that’s why I couldn’t find you?

07:43.560 --> 07:49.620
THE POWER OF FINANCE

08:43.980 --> 08:46.100
You…you’re so ridiculous,

08:46.140 --> 08:47.340
like a little schoolboy.

08:51.620 --> 08:52.800
What’s your deal?

08:57.860 --> 08:58.700
Bubble tea.

09:03.340 --> 09:05.520
What brings you here today?

09:06.320 --> 09:08.960
I just suddenly felt like
visiting your campus.

09:09.000 --> 09:10.820
Thought if I did see you,
I’d give you this bubble tea.

09:10.860 --> 09:12.100
If not,

09:12.140 --> 09:13.740
guess I’m drinking both cups myself.

09:15.700 --> 09:18.180
Since when did you get so sentimental?

09:18.680 --> 09:21.680
A call can solve it.
No need to drag fate into this.

09:23.940 --> 09:26.420
Your campus is really nice,

09:26.920 --> 09:28.260
so many little animals.

09:28.760 --> 09:30.360
Wild cats by the gate,

09:30.400 --> 09:32.800
swans in the manmade lake,

09:32.840 --> 09:35.540
even a piggy reading in the library.

09:47.300 --> 09:48.360
Lin Yingtao,

09:49.380 --> 09:50.240
listen up.

09:50.280 --> 09:51.820
This is your last shot to grow

09:51.860 --> 09:53.460
from 159cm to 160cm

09:53.500 --> 09:55.000
before adulthood hits.

09:55.040 --> 09:56.100
No crash diets,

09:56.140 --> 09:57.260
and no skipping bubble tea.

10:00.460 --> 10:01.580
First of all,

10:02.080 --> 10:03.280
I hit 160cm ages ago.

10:03.820 --> 10:06.740
Second, your bubble tea
has zero scientific ties to grow taller.

10:18.300 --> 10:20.460
I had my dad get Liang Hongfei’s number.

10:21.000 --> 10:22.780
She's Jiang Qiaoxi’s mom, after all.

10:22.820 --> 10:24.820
There’s no way
she doesn’t know where he is.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.160
And don’t thank me.

10:30.200 --> 10:32.280
Jiang Qiaoxi’s my friend too.

10:32.320 --> 10:34.360
Disappeared without a word.

10:34.860 --> 10:36.120
I want to know the reasons, too.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.820
Before, if I wanted to find him,

10:50.000 --> 10:51.060
I could go to his house,

10:51.100 --> 10:53.100
or the Olympiad training camp.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.840
But now?

10:55.880 --> 10:58.000
I could stare at a world map

10:58.740 --> 11:00.460
and still have no idea where to look.

11:01.020 --> 11:03.980
At least he’s not
literally in outer space.

11:14.520 --> 11:16.760
I kinda don’t want to grow up.

11:19.660 --> 11:21.980
Being an adult is not fun at all.

11:24.660 --> 11:25.800
It just feels like

11:26.700 --> 11:28.220
one hardship after another.

11:29.860 --> 11:31.640
Was being a kid really any easier?

11:32.240 --> 11:34.120
The moment we learned crying doesn't work,

11:34.660 --> 11:35.660
that’s when hardship starts, wasn’t it?

11:39.180 --> 11:40.800
It’s different.

11:40.840 --> 11:42.300
It’s the kind of

11:42.340 --> 11:44.560
hardship where you have to
start deciding how to live.

11:47.100 --> 11:48.320
The kind

11:48.360 --> 11:50.320
where you’re still just a kid,

11:51.580 --> 11:53.700
but forced to act like an adult.

12:14.480 --> 12:15.420
Lin Yingtao,

12:15.460 --> 12:17.040
since your roommates are all seniors,

12:17.080 --> 12:19.200
does anyone go to class with you?

12:21.100 --> 12:22.560
Honestly.

12:22.600 --> 12:24.280
going solo

12:24.320 --> 12:25.460
is also fine with me.

12:25.500 --> 12:26.600
It’s no big deal.

12:27.440 --> 12:29.040
In college,

12:29.080 --> 12:30.860
it’s not like that close
between people anyway.

12:33.260 --> 12:34.480
But don’t worry about me.

12:34.520 --> 12:36.400
My roommate seniors have been really kind.

12:37.500 --> 12:38.800
Lin Yingtao,

12:38.840 --> 12:41.700
you’ve barely started university,
yet you’re so grown-up.

12:43.260 --> 12:44.640
Yingtao!

12:46.000 --> 12:47.180
Senior!

12:48.560 --> 12:49.620
Where have you been?

12:49.660 --> 12:51.880
I just came back from the library.
Where have you been?

12:51.920 --> 12:53.500
I've been in the dormitory.

12:56.020 --> 12:57.400
This is Yu Qiao, my childhood friend,

12:57.440 --> 13:00.280
now a freshman at
Northern Aviation University next door.

13:00.320 --> 13:01.420
This is Meng Lijun, my senior.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.300
Hello, Senior.

13:03.940 --> 13:04.980
Hello.

13:06.060 --> 13:07.040
Yingtao.

13:07.580 --> 13:09.420
You said he’s your childhood friend,

13:11.740 --> 13:13.660
so you two grew up together, right?

13:14.760 --> 13:16.820
That’s literally
what childhood friend means.

13:17.640 --> 13:18.520
- Got it.
- What?

13:20.080 --> 13:21.360
Nice.

13:22.540 --> 13:24.740
What’s up… with her?

13:26.620 --> 13:28.320
- What are you doing?
- Come in.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.520
- Stop watching it.
- Shh…

13:35.120 --> 13:36.500
It's okay. I'm awake.

13:37.000 --> 13:38.160
- Just chat.
- Shh…

13:38.920 --> 13:40.100
You're awake.

13:41.800 --> 13:43.440
What are you doing, Senior?

13:44.020 --> 13:46.680
Court is in session!

13:46.720 --> 13:47.720
Now sit down!

13:48.820 --> 13:50.900
- Come on!
- Your Honor of the dorm court.

13:50.940 --> 13:52.280
What case are we on?

13:55.480 --> 13:56.940
Don't run away.

13:56.980 --> 13:58.240
Come back to me!

13:58.280 --> 13:59.280
What are you doing?

13:59.320 --> 14:00.900
This Ms. Lin

14:00.940 --> 14:02.600
is clearly guilty of

14:02.640 --> 14:04.120
hiding a secret boyfriend

14:04.160 --> 14:06.060
at the school next door.

14:06.100 --> 14:07.440
She played us all,

14:07.480 --> 14:09.260
never breathed a word. Right?

14:09.800 --> 14:11.640
No, seriously. He’s not my boyfriend!

14:11.680 --> 14:12.960
Just my childhood friend!

14:13.000 --> 14:14.180
I swear!

14:14.220 --> 14:15.440
Still lying?

14:15.480 --> 14:18.140
Last time during bath chat,
you admitted that

14:18.180 --> 14:20.680
the person you like grew up with you

14:20.720 --> 14:22.260
and is stupidly pretty.

14:22.300 --> 14:24.840
Sound exactly like
your Northern Aviation boy, no?

14:25.340 --> 14:27.180
It’s really not him.

14:27.220 --> 14:29.540
Your Honor. Explaining is hiding,

14:29.580 --> 14:30.500
hiding is confessing.

14:33.740 --> 14:35.240
It’s really not him.

14:38.400 --> 14:39.660
It’s someone else.

14:40.560 --> 14:41.780
Lin Qile,

14:42.280 --> 14:44.900
you’ve been hiding a second male lead!

14:45.440 --> 14:48.640
Brace yourself.
Tonight’s agenda is a full confession.

14:48.680 --> 14:50.940
You’re spilling every last detail

14:50.980 --> 14:53.020
of your 18-year backstory. No omissions.

14:55.560 --> 14:56.500
Come on.

15:02.480 --> 15:03.440
Talk.

15:04.920 --> 15:06.120
Really want to hear it?

15:06.160 --> 15:09.940
It’s… kind of a long story.

15:09.980 --> 15:11.500
Like, really long.

15:11.540 --> 15:13.720
The mood’s set, the stage is yours.

15:13.760 --> 15:16.000
No backing out now. Spill it.

15:24.520 --> 15:26.000
His name is Jiang Qiaoxi.

15:43.800 --> 15:45.440
We met…

15:46.240 --> 15:47.760
when we were nine.

15:48.720 --> 15:51.600
I’d never seen a kid like him.

15:51.640 --> 15:54.640
It felt like he’d wandered in
from another world.

15:55.180 --> 15:57.040
Before him,

15:57.080 --> 15:58.900
I thought I

15:58.940 --> 16:00.240
had all the answers.

16:00.780 --> 16:02.360
After?

16:02.400 --> 16:04.980
The more I knew him,
the less I understood about everything.

16:05.880 --> 16:06.940
I see.

16:06.980 --> 16:08.100
Childhood sweethearts,

16:08.140 --> 16:09.440
pure and unguarded.

16:10.780 --> 16:13.860
It’s giving teen angst novel vibes.

16:16.340 --> 16:19.860
Please please tell me
this story doesn’t involve

16:19.900 --> 16:22.380
backstabbing besties,
secret pregnancies, or cheating?

16:22.420 --> 16:23.740
For the love of literature,

16:23.780 --> 16:25.680
don’t let this turn into
some trashy paperback plot.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.540
It’s not that complicated,

16:28.080 --> 16:28.960
but…

16:29.840 --> 16:31.340
not simple either.

16:32.340 --> 16:34.820
When we were kids, adults called him

16:35.600 --> 16:39.040
that eccentric math genius.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.720
Everything he owned

16:42.260 --> 16:43.460
was black.

16:44.900 --> 16:46.140
Jiang Qiaoxi,

16:46.180 --> 16:48.180
what does your name mean?

16:48.220 --> 16:49.300
It doesn’t mean anything.

16:50.480 --> 16:53.280
He doesn’t know what his own name means…

16:55.640 --> 16:57.720
or even what color he likes.

16:57.760 --> 16:58.520
SMILE, GOOD

16:58.560 --> 17:00.080
Jiang Qiaoxi, make a wish!

17:00.120 --> 17:01.300
Du Shang.

17:02.100 --> 17:03.140
This wish……

17:03.980 --> 17:05.119
is yours now.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.460
You make it

17:06.960 --> 17:07.900
But I always

17:07.940 --> 17:10.839
saw warmth in him, flickers of it, anyway.

17:16.180 --> 17:17.260
I thought

17:17.760 --> 17:20.680
we’d just keep growing up
like that forever.

17:21.180 --> 17:23.900
Maybe even never really grow up at all.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.920
Then one day,

17:29.820 --> 17:31.000
his mother came.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.800
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

17:40.840 --> 17:43.300
Jiang Qiaoxi, write to me!

17:43.340 --> 17:44.760
You have to write to me!

17:44.800 --> 17:46.400
Yingtao!

17:46.440 --> 17:47.940
I’ll be back right after winter break!

17:50.280 --> 17:51.980
Pure love, too pure.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.380
So what happened…

17:55.880 --> 17:57.120
after his mother took him away?

17:59.160 --> 18:01.520
After that,
we didn’t see each other for six years.

18:03.540 --> 18:05.080
The next time we met…

18:06.680 --> 18:07.940
we were in high school.

18:09.280 --> 18:10.540
I don't know her.

18:17.340 --> 18:18.920
So from now on,

18:19.580 --> 18:21.040
if we meet again,

18:21.640 --> 18:22.840
let’s pretend we’re strangers.

18:22.880 --> 18:24.140
Let go!

18:24.180 --> 18:26.180
Let’s just pretend
we never knew each other at all.

18:33.700 --> 18:34.920
If you don't go, I'll go.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.220
Ms, I'm leaving.

18:38.700 --> 18:40.060
Lin Qile, you’re being unreasonable.

18:40.100 --> 18:41.100
You're being shameless.

18:41.140 --> 18:42.740
How am I the shameless one here?

18:42.780 --> 18:43.700
Chunlu is mine too.

18:44.300 --> 18:46.020
I’ve got my own pile of memories with it.

18:46.560 --> 18:47.520
Do whatever you want.

18:47.560 --> 18:48.580
Just don’t push your luck.

18:49.840 --> 18:51.200
How can you even say things like that?

19:00.340 --> 19:01.920
Yingtao!

19:01.960 --> 19:04.140
I haven’t changed!

19:04.180 --> 19:05.400
Yingtao!

19:18.900 --> 19:19.740
Jiang Qiaoxi.

19:19.780 --> 19:21.360
When you’re alone,

19:21.400 --> 19:24.140
do you ever feel lonely?

19:25.020 --> 19:27.720
I feel lonely, but not because I’m alone.

19:28.420 --> 19:29.680
Then what is the reason?

19:30.260 --> 19:31.500
Because of you.

19:32.800 --> 19:34.080
Before ten,

19:34.120 --> 19:35.700
I was always alone too.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.560
But math problems

19:37.600 --> 19:39.260
used to drown out the loneliness.

19:40.260 --> 19:43.260
After meeting you,
even math doesn’t work anymore.

19:43.880 --> 19:45.520
I can’t escape it now.

19:46.020 --> 19:47.160
Yingtao.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.500
I…

19:48.540 --> 19:50.560
might miss your year of being 18.

19:51.240 --> 19:52.740
But I won’t miss the moment

19:53.660 --> 19:55.280
you became an adult.

19:56.280 --> 19:59.400
I’ve always thought,
if you ever wore high heels

19:59.900 --> 20:02.560
and lipstick, you’d look stunning.

20:04.240 --> 20:05.980
I want to be the first to see it.

20:18.060 --> 20:18.900
Yingtao.

20:22.620 --> 20:23.860
Don't forget me.

20:31.200 --> 20:32.980
The last thing he said to me was…

20:35.680 --> 20:38.260
"Yingtao, don’t forget me."

20:39.660 --> 20:41.300
At the time,

20:41.340 --> 20:43.260
I didn’t think much of it.

20:45.260 --> 20:48.180
But later, every time
I remembered those words,

20:49.320 --> 20:50.660
they felt strange.

20:52.800 --> 20:54.200
What he didn’t know was

20:55.480 --> 20:57.220
compared to remembering him,

20:57.780 --> 20:59.780
forgetting him would’ve been far harder.

21:04.040 --> 21:05.740
So do you still want to find him?

21:09.020 --> 21:09.940
I have to find him.

21:10.860 --> 21:13.000
He’s already part of my life.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.700
So finding him

21:16.020 --> 21:18.520
is no different from finding myself.

21:19.060 --> 21:20.160
But don’t you think

21:20.660 --> 21:22.060
the reason he did all that

21:22.100 --> 21:23.540
was to disappear for good?

21:23.580 --> 21:25.440
No more encounters,
no chance of being found.

21:25.480 --> 21:26.980
It’s like hide-and-seek.

21:27.020 --> 21:27.980
Hiding is always easier

21:28.020 --> 21:29.820
than being found.

21:37.620 --> 21:39.840
Maybe I’m just cursed.

21:40.340 --> 21:42.140
I am always the seeker.

21:43.320 --> 21:45.160
How do you even plan to find him?
Go to Hong Kong?

21:45.660 --> 21:46.640
America?

21:46.680 --> 21:48.360
Like searching the ocean for a needle!

21:48.400 --> 21:50.160
Even if you had the time,

21:50.200 --> 21:52.500
where would you get that kind of money?

21:52.540 --> 21:54.520
I’ve already started saving.

21:55.880 --> 21:57.200
Yingtao.

21:57.240 --> 21:58.980
Stop being naive!

21:59.020 --> 22:01.440
"Gates and homes glow
at the west of Jiangqiao's crest"?

22:01.480 --> 22:03.900
It is gates and homes glow
with Lin Qile's presence!

22:03.940 --> 22:05.360
If the world has more like you,

22:05.400 --> 22:08.260
everyone would be happy.

22:10.100 --> 22:12.160
Have you ever thought, without you,

22:12.200 --> 22:13.680
what his life is

22:13.720 --> 22:15.200
going to be like now?

22:15.240 --> 22:17.240
But you? Without him,

22:17.280 --> 22:19.700
you'd be happier. Easier.

22:20.420 --> 22:22.240
Why torture yourself like this?

22:22.280 --> 22:24.040
That Northern Aviation guy

22:24.080 --> 22:25.100
seems perfect.

22:25.140 --> 22:26.200
Anyone can see he’s into you.

22:27.280 --> 22:28.840
Senior, please.

22:28.880 --> 22:30.480
We’ve been friends since childhood.

22:30.520 --> 22:32.520
I’ve told you this.

22:32.560 --> 22:34.820
And if I’ve chosen Jiang Qiaoxi,

22:34.860 --> 22:37.360
then it’s him. No one else.

22:38.360 --> 22:40.420
Fine. Go seeking if you must.

22:40.460 --> 22:41.420
With your whole life.

22:41.460 --> 22:43.380
And if you never find him? Be like

22:43.420 --> 22:45.180
the women Jiang Wenli played in the series

22:45.220 --> 22:46.080
The Grand Mansion,

22:46.120 --> 22:47.760
marry his photograph and call it a day.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.720
Senior.

23:07.140 --> 23:08.200
You remind me…

23:09.240 --> 23:11.580
so much of a friend.

23:12.080 --> 23:14.640
Every time you speak,
it’s like hearing her voice again.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.780
Jiang Qiaoxi.

23:29.600 --> 23:31.120
I told our story

23:31.620 --> 23:33.180
to the seniors,

23:34.940 --> 23:35.820
like I’ve brought you

23:36.600 --> 23:38.360
into my new life.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.220
From now on,

23:40.860 --> 23:43.100
this place will also
have some part of you.

23:44.760 --> 23:45.860
Yingtao.

23:46.900 --> 23:48.820
If your love for him,

23:48.860 --> 23:51.140
is no better than my crush
into some celebrities.

24:01.960 --> 24:02.800
You hearing me?

24:25.380 --> 24:26.720
Jiang Qiaoxi.

24:28.340 --> 24:29.660
Where on earth are you?

24:54.580 --> 24:55.500
Look.

24:55.540 --> 24:57.400
Fang Chang just texted. She’s already
at the restaurant saving us seats.

24:57.440 --> 24:58.420
She’s there already?

24:59.120 --> 25:01.640
She says she’s starving,
tells us to hurry the hell up.

25:01.680 --> 25:03.900
Tell her to order and eat first!

25:05.180 --> 25:07.700
We’re all close here.
No need for formalities.

25:07.740 --> 25:08.860
No way!

25:08.900 --> 25:10.920
This is your farewell dinner
before heading home.

25:10.960 --> 25:12.140
- Alright.
- Do it properly.

25:12.180 --> 25:13.640
- Okay.
- Hurry up!

25:13.680 --> 25:15.040
Come on, Yingtao!

25:20.620 --> 25:21.800
Ling Qile!

25:23.380 --> 25:25.400
Hello, Ling Qile.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.620
- Hello.
- I…

25:28.660 --> 25:30.860
I’ve seen you often at the library.

25:30.900 --> 25:33.300
Mind sharing what you’re reading?

25:37.680 --> 25:40.520
Either Essential Vocabulary for CET-4

25:41.880 --> 25:44.140
or maybe Harry Potter.

25:44.180 --> 25:45.780
I love Harry Potter too.

25:46.280 --> 25:48.480
Let’s… be friends.

25:56.040 --> 25:56.880
Your shoelace is untied.

26:03.120 --> 26:05.260
Thank you, but I’m sorry.

26:05.300 --> 26:06.160
What’s going on?

26:06.200 --> 26:08.080
I'll take you to learn a new language.

26:08.120 --> 26:09.740
How about sign language?

26:09.780 --> 26:11.320
Why would I learn sign language?

26:11.360 --> 26:12.440
You still don’t get it?

26:12.480 --> 26:13.660
It'll be easier next time

26:13.700 --> 26:15.080
you’re in this situation.

26:15.120 --> 26:16.480
Just pretend you can’t speak

26:16.520 --> 26:18.680
and wave your hands around.

26:18.720 --> 26:19.980
People wants to talk to you.

26:20.020 --> 26:20.880
But no one you cares to know.

26:21.420 --> 26:22.440
Senior.

26:23.280 --> 26:24.700
Something just came up.

26:24.740 --> 26:26.960
You guys go ahead and eat,

26:27.000 --> 26:29.500
don’t wait for me. I’ll be back soon!

26:31.860 --> 26:33.160
Seriously, go without me!

26:58.440 --> 26:59.320
Hello.

27:01.580 --> 27:02.640
Auntie Liang.

27:03.180 --> 27:04.620
This is Lin Yingtao.

27:04.660 --> 27:05.660
Well…

27:05.700 --> 27:08.400
Sorry to bother you, but I wanted to ask…

27:09.460 --> 27:11.700
He’s not the Jiang Qiaoxi
you knew anymore.

27:12.340 --> 27:13.760
Stop looking for him.

27:14.300 --> 27:16.220
Can you tell me where he is?

27:16.720 --> 27:18.680
He won’t answer my calls anymore.

27:19.700 --> 27:22.300
He’s made his choice,
and nothing can change that.

27:22.800 --> 27:24.500
If I don't share it with you,

27:24.540 --> 27:26.160
at least he and I have a chance
to be related.

27:26.820 --> 27:28.000
But if I do tell,

27:28.500 --> 27:31.100
we can’t even be mother and son anymore.

27:32.140 --> 27:33.220
Yingtao.

27:33.260 --> 27:35.600
Enjoy your college life.

27:36.420 --> 27:37.740
Stop searching for him

27:38.240 --> 27:39.580
and don’t call me again.

27:48.720 --> 27:49.860
Sisi,

27:49.900 --> 27:51.420
I wish for you

27:51.460 --> 27:54.060
"to conquer every horizon,

27:54.100 --> 27:57.380
by climbing every peak."

27:59.220 --> 28:01.780
From me,
"Since we parted like drifting clouds,

28:02.680 --> 28:04.160
a decade has flowed away like water."

28:04.200 --> 28:06.640
Is this phrasing appropriate?

28:06.680 --> 28:08.040
Does it suit the moment?

28:09.100 --> 28:10.280
What’s wrong with it?

28:11.740 --> 28:15.480
Life is like drifting clouds
and flowing water,

28:16.720 --> 28:17.800
unpredictable, ever-changing.

28:18.300 --> 28:19.420
Doesn’t it fit the moment?

28:20.120 --> 28:21.680
- No.
- No?

28:21.720 --> 28:24.160
Let me lie down and think.
I’ll tell you in a sec.

28:27.740 --> 28:29.520
Why are they both down?

28:29.560 --> 28:30.600
Normal.

28:32.020 --> 28:32.980
Are you okay?

28:33.020 --> 28:34.040
Yes.

28:36.140 --> 28:38.320
Yingtao, hate to say it.

28:38.360 --> 28:40.220
But you’re a freshman.

28:40.260 --> 28:41.660
A time that you find

28:41.700 --> 28:43.580
everything new and fun

28:43.620 --> 28:45.380
and full of hope.

28:45.880 --> 28:48.220
Yet here you are, having
a goodbye dinner with us old grads.

28:48.920 --> 28:50.740
What are you talking about, Senior?

28:51.660 --> 28:53.260
Let me toast you too.

28:54.560 --> 28:55.820
I…

28:56.620 --> 28:58.320
I can’t recite ancient poetry like them,

28:58.360 --> 28:59.720
I wish you to

29:00.220 --> 29:02.180
ace in civil service exam
and secure the job!

29:02.220 --> 29:03.220
Alright.

29:12.220 --> 29:13.400
What are you doing?

29:16.720 --> 29:18.640
Hey Chuan.

29:20.220 --> 29:23.700
Starting today,
you won’t be my student anymore.

29:24.200 --> 29:25.740
This number here,

29:25.780 --> 29:27.520
it’s your new teacher’s.

29:27.560 --> 29:29.780
Be nice to her, don’t make her mad.

29:31.000 --> 29:33.200
Don’t worry, I’ll talk to your parents.

29:33.240 --> 29:34.300
Bye now.

29:36.760 --> 29:38.460
What do you mean?

29:38.500 --> 29:42.680
This is the number of
the family I tutor for.

29:42.720 --> 29:45.800
Their son’s in elementary, third grade.

29:45.840 --> 29:48.100
Well-behaved and bright.

29:48.140 --> 29:49.720
The rate is 80 yuan an hour.

29:49.760 --> 29:52.420
If you teach well,
you could make serious cash each month.

29:54.120 --> 29:55.320
Why are you

29:55.360 --> 29:56.920
passing this job to me?

29:56.960 --> 29:58.860
Aren’t you trying to find your boyfriend?

29:58.900 --> 30:00.920
Just saving money won’t be enough.

30:00.960 --> 30:03.060
You need to earn more while spend less.

30:03.100 --> 30:04.440
Isn’t that the smarter plan?

30:09.000 --> 30:10.000
I…

30:11.600 --> 30:12.840
I thought…

30:13.680 --> 30:15.800
you also believed
I was being utterly foolish.

30:18.160 --> 30:19.840
What’s "foolish"?

30:20.680 --> 30:22.060
What’s "smart"?

30:22.740 --> 30:23.800
Yingtao.

30:24.720 --> 30:27.280
Not everyone’s like you.

30:27.780 --> 30:29.360
Unbreakable.

30:29.400 --> 30:31.440
Never changed.

30:31.480 --> 30:34.660
Sharing more love to others than yourself.

30:34.700 --> 30:36.940
If that’s what you call "foolish",

30:36.980 --> 30:39.000
then I guess I’m "smart".

30:39.640 --> 30:41.260
Do I seem any better off?

30:52.420 --> 30:55.160
Senior, I’m not as strong as you think.

30:56.840 --> 30:57.800
Truth is,

30:57.840 --> 31:00.720
I don’t know what to do

31:00.760 --> 31:01.780
or what I’m even capable of.

31:02.660 --> 31:04.680
I’m terrified.

31:04.720 --> 31:06.700
There’s so much

31:07.320 --> 31:10.060
doesn't make sense to me.
I don't understand.

31:11.780 --> 31:13.860
Why did Jiang Qiaoxi

31:14.860 --> 31:16.200
say goodbye like that?

31:16.860 --> 31:18.380
He didn’t need to study math anymore.

31:18.420 --> 31:19.700
Why did he vanish…

31:20.440 --> 31:22.100
so suddenly?

31:22.600 --> 31:24.860
Why cut me off completely?

31:25.440 --> 31:27.360
What terrifies me most

31:27.400 --> 31:29.660
is him telling me "Don’t forget me."

31:30.660 --> 31:31.980
But what if I remember him always,

31:32.020 --> 31:33.940
while he forgets me?

31:34.620 --> 31:36.640
Even after ten, twenty years,

31:36.680 --> 31:37.840
I know I’ll still remember.

31:37.880 --> 31:40.080
But where will he be then?

31:42.720 --> 31:44.000
Will I still exist in his memory?

31:45.360 --> 31:47.600
Have you ever heard a story called

31:47.640 --> 31:50.480
The Miraculous Journey of Edward Tulane?

31:52.560 --> 31:55.720
It’s a fairy tale about

31:55.760 --> 31:59.420
a porcelain rabbit named Edward.

31:59.460 --> 32:02.360
After being separated from his owner,

32:02.400 --> 32:04.400
he begins to wander.

32:05.180 --> 32:06.420
He is lonely.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.740
His life grows harder.

32:09.280 --> 32:11.640
No one remembers his name.

32:12.940 --> 32:14.080
In those days,

32:14.120 --> 32:15.360
unloved,

32:15.400 --> 32:17.000
forgotten,

32:17.040 --> 32:19.020
he could only repeat to himself,

32:19.560 --> 32:21.740
"I have someone I deeply in love,

32:21.780 --> 32:23.900
and I was once loved deeply too.

32:24.620 --> 32:26.820
Someone will always remember my name."

32:27.360 --> 32:28.600
This is how

32:28.640 --> 32:30.820
he was able to survive

32:30.860 --> 32:32.240
during those days.

32:35.560 --> 32:37.520
So does this story

32:39.000 --> 32:40.220
have a happy ending?

32:41.100 --> 32:43.500
Yingtao, only stories

32:44.000 --> 32:45.840
without love

32:46.340 --> 32:47.840
have bad endings.

32:49.660 --> 32:52.140
In the end,
someone remembered Edward’s name,

32:52.180 --> 32:54.260
and he returned home.

32:54.760 --> 32:57.120
Yingtao, I think your rabbit,

32:57.160 --> 33:00.200
because he knew you’d remember him,

33:00.240 --> 33:02.220
he could endure all that suffering.

33:02.840 --> 33:03.920
So…

33:06.360 --> 33:08.920
maybe that’s why Jiang Qiaoxi

33:10.560 --> 33:12.920
told me not to forget him.

33:13.620 --> 33:15.760
Yingtao, you’re someone

33:15.800 --> 33:18.580
who makes others happy.

33:19.500 --> 33:22.040
People like you don’t get bad endings.

33:23.140 --> 33:24.960
Yes. A happy ending for you,
non-negotiable.

33:25.840 --> 33:26.920
Drink more.

33:27.420 --> 33:29.500
Never leads to bad endings.

33:30.100 --> 33:32.480
Absolutely not. Rest assured.

33:35.760 --> 33:36.820
Fang Chang!

33:37.840 --> 33:39.100
Sit up!

33:41.800 --> 33:43.600
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

33:43.640 --> 33:45.640
Wish you smooth sailing

33:45.680 --> 33:48.500
and may my own journey flow just as easy.

33:48.540 --> 33:50.720
- All the best!
- All the best!

34:05.340 --> 34:08.260
THE MIRACULOUS JOURNEY OF EDWARD TULANE

35:38.340 --> 35:39.480
I'm leaving.

35:57.400 --> 35:59.440
Let's take a look at
the following sentence.

36:19.260 --> 36:22.160
Chuan, focus.

36:26.840 --> 36:28.000
Ms. Yingtao,

36:28.540 --> 36:30.860
this cello is too loud.

36:30.900 --> 36:32.000
I can’t focus.

36:37.040 --> 36:38.100
How about this?

36:38.140 --> 36:40.360
I’ll talk to your parents

36:40.400 --> 36:41.920
and ask if your brother
can practice later.

36:42.420 --> 36:44.940
Ms Yingtao, don’t bother.

36:44.980 --> 36:46.080
They won’t listen.

36:46.120 --> 36:47.640
My brother’s got a cello competition

36:47.680 --> 36:49.480
in a few days,

36:49.520 --> 36:51.440
so he practices nonstop.

36:51.480 --> 36:52.840
Mom and Dad love hearing him play.

36:52.880 --> 36:54.560
They don’t even notice me anymore.

36:57.000 --> 36:58.660
Who said that?

36:59.760 --> 37:02.160
Your mom and dad always ask me,

37:02.200 --> 37:04.740
"How did Chuan do today?"

37:05.240 --> 37:06.740
They care about you so much.

37:24.800 --> 37:26.700
Chuan, you know what?

37:26.740 --> 37:29.840
I… have a friend,

37:30.340 --> 37:32.680
just like you, with a sibling.

37:33.220 --> 37:36.320
Kids always get compared.

37:36.860 --> 37:38.540
When we were little,

37:38.580 --> 37:39.940
my friend…

37:40.620 --> 37:42.800
also struggled with this a lot

37:43.580 --> 37:44.420
That was tough times.

37:46.700 --> 37:48.280
Then what color do you like?

37:49.020 --> 37:50.260
I never thought about it.

37:51.700 --> 37:53.140
But…

37:53.180 --> 37:54.540
I'm starting to like black.

37:54.580 --> 37:57.040
What else? Think of another one,

37:57.080 --> 37:58.100
and like it from now on.

38:01.780 --> 38:04.000
Red. I like red.

38:05.400 --> 38:06.900
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:06.940 --> 38:08.940
Next birthday,

38:08.980 --> 38:09.940
I’ll make a wish for you.

38:10.580 --> 38:12.980
A wish that your parents
love you exactly as you are.

38:13.020 --> 38:14.060
Okay?

38:15.300 --> 38:16.680
Then what about your wish?

38:18.000 --> 38:19.020
What is it?

38:19.060 --> 38:20.720
My wish?

38:22.280 --> 38:24.600
That all of us stay together,

38:25.100 --> 38:25.940
never apart.

38:26.980 --> 38:28.400
Then keep your wish.

38:29.820 --> 38:30.960
To me,

38:31.460 --> 38:32.680
this matters more.

38:34.940 --> 38:36.020
Did he ever

38:36.060 --> 38:37.520
outshine his brother in the end?

38:39.140 --> 38:41.400
Later, when he grew up,

38:41.440 --> 38:43.620
he realized there is nothing to compete.

38:43.660 --> 38:45.080
What truly matters is

38:45.120 --> 38:47.560
knowing who you are

38:47.600 --> 38:49.160
and what you really like to do.

38:53.080 --> 38:55.620
What I truly like is having class
with Ms. Yingtao.

38:59.000 --> 39:01.820
Ms. Yingtao also like teaching Chuan,

39:01.860 --> 39:03.060
such an amazing kid.

39:03.100 --> 39:05.800
A fourth-grader who writes
such beautiful essays

39:05.840 --> 39:07.600
Who knows?

39:07.640 --> 39:09.680
We might be looking
at a future literary star.

39:11.740 --> 39:12.800
Little writer,

39:13.440 --> 39:14.480
ready for your homework?

39:16.060 --> 39:16.940
Come on.

39:18.440 --> 39:19.420
This one.

39:20.080 --> 39:21.140
This sentence.

39:23.180 --> 39:25.940
Ms. Yingtao, I just realized

39:25.980 --> 39:28.340
this cello doesn’t sound so loud anymore.

39:49.400 --> 39:50.440
Jiang Qiaoxi,

39:50.480 --> 39:51.680
you know what?

39:52.360 --> 39:55.920
The more I teach that little boy Chuan,

39:55.960 --> 39:57.980
the more he reminds me of you.

39:58.020 --> 40:00.660
MATHEMATICS WINTER CAMP
PARTICIPANT ID: JIANG QIAOXI

40:00.700 --> 40:02.940
Are you, when you were little,

40:03.440 --> 40:05.060
in need of me?

40:22.120 --> 40:23.300
Take a break.

40:23.340 --> 40:25.200
Weekend tomorrow.
Off to Normal University again?

40:32.780 --> 40:33.620
Take this hairspray.

40:34.740 --> 40:35.900
Why give it to me?

40:35.940 --> 40:37.140
Don’t you need it anymore?

40:37.180 --> 40:38.180
I don’t need it.

40:38.220 --> 40:40.320
With our school’s gender ratio,

40:40.360 --> 40:41.540
who’s there to impress?

40:41.580 --> 40:43.740
If you don’t need it, then I do?

40:43.780 --> 40:45.680
Isn’t your childhood friend there?

40:45.720 --> 40:47.400
You dine with her every weekend.

40:48.680 --> 40:50.280
With your effort and attitude,

40:51.060 --> 40:52.140
it’s only a matter of time.

40:52.180 --> 40:53.060
Don’t say that!

40:53.860 --> 40:56.120
That is not the reason that I visited her.

40:58.140 --> 40:59.760
Okay. My bad.

40:59.800 --> 41:00.940
My bad.

41:02.460 --> 41:03.300
Hello.

41:03.340 --> 41:05.340
Yu Qiao, get on QQ now. It’s an emergency!

41:05.980 --> 41:07.740
Why so dramatic? Is the sky falling?

41:07.780 --> 41:09.840
Worse than the sky falling.

41:15.420 --> 41:18.080
CAI FANGYUAN

41:20.460 --> 41:22.640
I just randomly saw this

41:22.680 --> 41:23.840
on my MSN feed.

41:23.880 --> 41:27.040
It was posted by a Year-9 girl
in Hong Kong.

41:27.080 --> 41:29.700
Is this Jiang Qiaoxi? Am I seeing things?

41:29.740 --> 41:31.480
It really looks like Jiang Qiaoxi.

41:33.020 --> 41:34.440
Shall we tell Yingtao?

41:34.940 --> 41:37.140
Is telling Yingtao a good thing?

41:44.960 --> 41:45.800
No one says a word.

41:45.840 --> 41:47.540
Whoever dares tell Yingtao, I'd tear up

41:47.580 --> 41:49.060
his mouth. You hear me?

41:53.180 --> 41:54.280
Yu Qiao, especially you.

41:54.320 --> 41:55.200
GROUP CHAT: CAI FANGYUAN,
YU QIAO, QIN YEYUN, DU SHANG

42:07.380 --> 42:09.100
Yu Qiao, are you done reading?

42:09.740 --> 42:11.340
INCOMING CALL FROM QIN YEYUN

42:19.040 --> 42:20.260
The post is already deleted.

42:20.300 --> 42:21.780
Only we few saw it.

42:22.460 --> 42:24.540
If I stay silent, Yingtao will never know.

42:24.580 --> 42:26.240
Why can’t Yingtao know?

42:27.340 --> 42:28.640
Is she not supposed to?

42:28.680 --> 42:30.380
Yu Qiao, are you seriously
still pretending?

42:41.880 --> 42:44.380
Yu Qiao, are you seriously
still pretending?

42:44.420 --> 42:45.960
Others might not know, but you do.

42:46.500 --> 42:48.680
If Yingtao finds out
Jiang Qiaoxi’s in Hong Kong,

42:48.720 --> 42:50.020
she’d book a flight for today,

42:50.060 --> 42:51.140
not even waiting for tomorrow.

42:51.640 --> 42:52.940
Hong Kong is so far.

42:52.980 --> 42:54.180
Would you really let her go alone?

42:54.680 --> 42:55.960
Actually, it's not that far,

42:56.460 --> 42:58.100
just over 1000 nautical miles.

42:58.700 --> 43:00.420
Barring extreme weather,

43:00.460 --> 43:02.000
I, No. 737800,

43:02.040 --> 43:04.300
- can make it.
- Yu Qiao, you’re addicted to playing hero?

43:04.340 --> 43:07.360
Go fly your damn plane to Leshan, Sichuan.

43:07.400 --> 43:08.860
Land right by the Giant Buddha,

43:08.900 --> 43:10.520
tell him to get up,
and park your ass on his throne!

45:41.360 --> 45:44.060
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
